2026-09-17: Release scope update.

- Deferred behavioral comprehension accuracy and technical-validation analyses/results to a future dataset update. Moved the behavior tables and their documentation, the technical-validation status directory, and historical/internal validation reports outside the release; preserved all files privately.
- Updated the directory index and publishing documentation. Added code/config/release_scope.json and made structural/BIDS checking scripts require report output outside the release.
- Kept anonymous participant demographics, EEG, stimuli, features, annotations and event metadata unchanged. No scientific data were rescaled, regenerated or copied.

2026-09-16: Unit metadata and documentation correction only.

- Changed the units column in all 75 raw channels.tsv files (4,800 rows) from V to µV, matching their BrainVision header units. No raw EEG, NPZ, stimulus or feature values were rescaled or regenerated.
- Corrected README descriptions of behavior-table layout, available code/results, feature extraction status and historical packaging paths. Documented remaining reproducibility limitations without changing code.
- Retained existing validation reports as dated records; no report or checksum file inside the release was regenerated by this correction.

2026-09-16: In-place directory reorganization, no data copying or numerical changes. Active index paths and processing output paths updated. Historical validation archived. Publication audit is separate.

